"In Safari, Notes, Mail, or another text app, touch and hold a word, then adjust the selection handles to include the text you want to change." = "在 Safari、備忘錄、郵件或其他文字 App 中，長按一個字詞，然後拖曳選取控制點，選取要處理的文字。";
"Highlight a sentence, paragraph, or message before opening the menu." = "先反白一句話、段落或訊息，再開啟選單。";
"Open the action menu" = "開啟操作選單";
"Tap Share or the More button in the selection menu. If Runse is not visible, open More and enable it for next time." = "在選取選單中點一下「分享」或「更多」。如果看不到 Runse，請開啟「更多」並為下次啟用。";
"Look for the system share sheet or action list after selecting text." = "選取文字後，找到系統分享面板或操作列表。";
"Pin Runse" = "固定 Runse";
"If Runse is hidden in More, enable it and drag it near the top so it appears directly next time." = "如果 Runse 隱藏在「更多」中，請啟用它並拖到靠前位置，這樣下次會直接顯示。";
"You only need to pin Runse once for each app or menu style where you use it." = "在每個使用 Runse 的 App 或選單樣式中，只需固定一次。";
"Enable Runse" = "啟用 Runse";
"Drag Runse near the top" = "將 Runse 拖到靠前位置";
"Choose Runse" = "選擇 Runse";
"Tap Runse in the share sheet or action list. The selected text opens in Runse with the available actions." = "在分享面板或操作列表中點一下 Runse。選取的文字會在 Runse 中開啟，並顯示可用操作。";
"Runse receives only the selected text and prepares it for transformation." = "Runse 只會接收選取的文字，並準備進行轉換。";
"Refine or translate" = "潤飾或翻譯";
"Choose Refine to improve wording, or Translate to convert the text into your default language. Copy the result back where you need it." = "選擇「潤飾」改善用字，或選擇「翻譯」將文字轉成預設語言。再將結果複製回需要的位置。";
"Use Refine for clearer writing. Use Translate when the selected text should change languages." = "需要更清楚的文字時使用「潤飾」；需要切換語言時使用「翻譯」。";
"Adjust defaults" = "調整預設值";
"Open Settings to change the default translation language. Open Providers if you need to update the model, endpoint, or API key." = "開啟「設定」可變更預設翻譯語言。需要更新模型、端點或 API 金鑰時，請開啟「提供商」。";
"You can reopen this guide later from Settings." = "之後可從「設定」再次開啟本指南。";
"Touch and hold this sample text, then drag the handles to select the part you want Runse to process." = "長按這段示範文字，然後拖曳控制點，選取要讓 Runse 處理的部分。";
"The product update is good but it sounds a little rough. Please make it clearer for customers." = "產品更新不錯，但聽起來有點生硬。請讓它對客戶更清楚。";
"Settings keeps the guide available and stores your default translation language." = "「設定」會保留本指南入口，並儲存預設翻譯語言。";
